omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1ork75gkBKQQ7kNvwFOev2X&_nc_oc=AdqBbQPBwGcBKyuS8mffkmWPlBlmgTHSvgZl_7c3Io1BP35DmUryQWq9h9JKirV7zDU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLoY1tOd155WA-UK6oB2jiHUJENxiLNGwQgGvLM8aE7fQ&oe=6AB29D34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7utXDkgO2MUQ7kNvwHRNmpB&_nc_oc=Adq2AxyJopppesCViE-6-MBjLrEFZAV-MKo2-6cxLsm0Yc0iFR8RuyuUKoAgm1B482g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJSIS41OOvY7sLJGH-E1X5RUexHTnnw8JrC4fgJhs7QkQ&oe=6AB29E96"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2mIbH7d2MpEQ7kNvwE-w4e3&_nc_oc=AdrX830sfmrW3l-GJPp7rMsJ7ROoH2gpc5EiArzXlOa5l1uEWZ8Zy7Pr4cAFnY3_RDk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLLZVJbXP2OLIP0xvjLAaxDRhEnaabUzBuP9a4USwrbmQ&oe=6AB27B77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://